              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "6b17d849-ba9e-4ae5-b722-9125cab92e0a"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient describes feeling like they are holding everything together by staying one step away from falling apart."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "26891357-ed63-44a1-9fba-76e424d126ce"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "9f8c82a1-e167-47bc-9855-ef7d90d06940"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They report being more irritable than usual, with small questions feeling like criticism."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "28dee851-0fcd-464e-977c-459a1eb763b2"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "26891357-ed63-44a1-9fba-76e424d126ce"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "f60e5d27-4fd4-45f7-b65b-73990e70f7d0"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient feels ashamed about their irritability and the impact on their partner, Nora."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "32253a7d-abe8-49e8-a0bf-5fe5abd1d41e"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "28dee851-0fcd-464e-977c-459a1eb763b2"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They describe being able to sit on the couch with their partner while halfway through an email in their head, not hearing what their partner says.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "c56563e6-ca56-451f-b8d5-e3f19b29cb96"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "b49d5024-c4dd-4846-b0c7-810626825456"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports that their family relied on them heavily when their father got sick last year, and they became the one who remembers appointments, calls people, and keeps the tone calm."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "3cb8cf51-7c79-497b-9865-36e204482db5"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They state they do not know how to turn that role off."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "d2a1cbc1-4fd3-4c22-9ae2-a0cb3f98494d"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "c35b79fc-4d72-41ee-95fd-17d284e9c918"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient expresses a strong belief that they should not complain because others have worse problems.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "89dfd7c8-95e1-4aa9-8520-e051aaa8f3a7"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "da81f1db-85e4-4bec-b486-aee5d6395703"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "99360bef-dd9a-43fc-9de1-3f979d80a075"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "dbb4fd4f-45a2-430e-9cea-78b0842700c0"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports moments when things feel dark enough that they do not want to be here."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "6ea5e1d2-83a6-4e48-a3b2-aef8dabf48ae"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "148a3393-6d8c-4765-b4d2-43653d0c6438"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "da81f1db-85e4-4bec-b486-aee5d6395703"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "These thoughts are not constant but occur after a bad night or after disappointing someone."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "99360bef-dd9a-43fc-9de1-3f979d80a075"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "dbb4fd4f-45a2-430e-9cea-78b0842700c0"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They describe wishing they could disappear for a while and thinking that people might be better off if they were not making everything harder."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "f2a30024-924c-46a2-97a5-1d4ce72bb47e"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "3403cdd6-7b5f-4688-9525-c961ca6309d8"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient denies having a plan to hurt themselves or wanting to die, stating they want the pressure to stop."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "566314dd-b1ce-453b-8161-98ca41e75253"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "52c4d8d7-a7b8-4020-8f07-3343da2b2602"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They report feeling ashamed of these thoughts and try to push them away and act normal.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "f8cf21ee-0f6c-4e11-8100-0c4ce3777629"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "a8a6e4b7-6ca0-4af3-8ee1-0bfc2bd310d3"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports that their partner Nora, their dog, and their sister have been helpful in getting through difficult moments."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "a8a6e4b7-6ca0-4af3-8ee1-0bfc2bd310d3"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Work can also be a distraction, though the patient acknowledges this is not always helpful.\n"
          }
        ]
